# Raw material, not the site.
#
# The photo folders are the raw shoots. The published versions live in
# public/photos, public/history-photos and public/launch-photos — the
# "Photos history of development" folder is byte-identical to
# public/history-photos, so tracking it was tracking the same 12MB twice.
# The old "/Photos/" rule never matched these names, which is how 76MB of
# raw JPGs ended up in the history.
#
# knowledge-rack/library/raw is a byte-identical copy of knowledge-rack/inbox,
# made by the build script. The inbox is the source of truth and stays
# tracked; the copy is regenerated by every build and is proved identical
# by scripts/check-knowledge-rack.mjs.
/Photos/
/Photos (Protocol Beta)/
/Photos history of development/
/photos/
/knowledge-rack/library/

/vite.config.js
/vite.config.d.ts

